WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
In just eight months since I took office,

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.800
we have secured commitments and money

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.080
already paid for $17 trillion.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.780
Think of it, four years less than a trillion,

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:16.040
eight months, much more than $17 trillion.

